SmartPro Authentication Flow
    First User
    Initially we seed an Admin manually.
        Example:
        {
        "email": "admin@smartpro.com",
        "password": "admin123",
        "role": "ADMIN"
        }
    Only once.
        
    User Journey:
        Employee
            Register
            ↓
            Login
            ↓
            Create PR
            ↓
            Track PR Status
        Manager
            Login
            ↓
            See Pending Approvals
            ↓
            Approve / Reject
        Purchase Team
            Login
            ↓
            See Approved PRs
            ↓
            Create RFQ
            ↓
            Add Quotations
            ↓
            Select Vendor
            ↓
            Generate PO
        Admin
            Login
            ↓
            Manage Users
            ↓
            Activate / Deactivate
            ↓
            Change Roles
    
